  "body": "Closes #1129.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nThank you for contributing to the HTML Standard! Please describe the change you are making and complete the checklist below if your change is not editorial.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\r\n   * Right now each browser does something different: Chrome implements this; Firefox does some sort of sniffing for windows-1252 characters only; and WebKit skips the bytes step and creates a document from a string\r\n   * Chrome implements this\r\n   * In https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/1129#issuecomment-318080580 @annevk offered a semi-recommendation that we do this. Still up for it, @annevk?\r\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\r\n   * https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/29419\r\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\r\n   * Chrome: https://crbug.com/1221018\r\n   * Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1717678\r\n   * Safari: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=227259\r\n\r\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\r\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\r\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\r\n\r\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\r\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\r\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\r\n    and remove what's below.\r\n-->\r\n***\r\n\r\n### :boom: Error: Wattsi server error :boom: ###\r\n\r\n[PR Preview](https://github.com/tobie/pr-preview#pr-preview) failed to build. _(Last tried on Jun 22, 2021, 5:09 PM UTC)_.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>More</summary>\r\n\r\n\r\nPR Preview relies on a number of web services to run. There seems to be an issue with the following one:\r\n\r\n:rotating_light: [Wattsi Server](https://github.com/domenic/wattsi-server) - Wattsi Server is the web service used to build the WHATWG HTML spec.\r\n\r\n:link: [Related URL](https://build.whatwg.org/wattsi)\r\n\r\n```\r\n<html>\r\n<head><title>524 Origin Time-out</title></head>\r\n<body bgcolor=\"white\">\r\n<center><h1>524 Origin Time-out</h1></center>\r\n<hr><center>cloudflare-nginx</center>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n_If you don't have enough information above to solve the error by yourself (or to understand to which web service the error is related to, if any), please [file an issue](https://github.com/tobie/pr-preview/issues/new?title=Error%20not%20surfaced%20properly&body=See%20whatwg/html%236781.)._\r\n</details>\r\n",
